[38;2;124;124;124mSo the complete picture:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- Squares with origin as vertex: from Case 1 (z1 = 0) and sub-case 2c (where one[0m[38;2;124;124;124mof z2, z3, z4 = 0)[0m
